#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: vn-address-woocommerce.php includes/class-vn-address-admin.php:61
#: includes/class-vn-address-admin.php:77
msgid "VN Address for WooCommerce"
msgstr "VN Address for WooCommerce"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: vn-address-woocommerce.php
msgid "https://jungdev.com/plugins/vn-address-for-woocommerce"
msgstr "https://jungdev.com/plugins/vn-address-for-woocommerce"

#. Description of the plugin
#: vn-address-woocommerce.php
msgid ""
"Integrates Vietnamese administrative addresses into WooCommerce with a "
"bundled Province/District/Ward dataset. Supports converting addresses from "
"the old structure to the new one."
msgstr ""
"Intègre les adresses administratives vietnamiennes à WooCommerce avec un jeu "
"de données Province/District/Commune fourni avec l'extension. Prend en "
"charge la conversion des adresses de l'ancienne structure vers la nouvelle."

#. Author of the plugin
#: vn-address-woocommerce.php
msgid "jungdev"
msgstr "jungdev"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: vn-address-woocommerce.php
msgid "https://jungdev.com"
msgstr "https://jungdev.com"

#. translators: %s: link to WooCommerce Settings > Advanced > Features
#: includes/class-vn-address-admin.php:65
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Your Checkout page uses the WooCommerce block-based checkout, and your "
"WooCommerce version is too old for this plugin's block checkout support. "
"Update WooCommerce to 8.9+, or enable \"Cart and checkout shortcodes\" under "
"%s to use the Classic Checkout instead."
msgstr ""
"Votre page de commande utilise le checkout par blocs de WooCommerce, mais "
"votre version de WooCommerce est trop ancienne pour la prise en charge du "
"checkout par blocs de cette extension. Mettez à jour WooCommerce vers la "
"version 8.9 ou supérieure, ou activez \"Cart and checkout shortcodes\" sous "
"%s pour utiliser le Checkout classique."

